    "created_at": "2015-12-12T10:30:45Z",
    "updated_at": "2015-12-12T10:30:45Z",
    "body": "I have commented on crbug.com/568603\n\nFrom a spec point of view, if definitions are to be reused, then the current BlobCallback with a nullable argument is as inclusive as it could be. In some sense Gecko were previously in violation of the spec when they passed a non-File Blob or null to this callback.\n",
